{%- comment -%}
  Felice Acupuncture shared icon set (paths exported from Figma, fills set to currentColor).
  Usage: {% render 'fa-icon', icon: 'phone' %}
  Size icons with CSS (.fa-icon defaults to 1em). Every icon is decorative (aria-hidden, focusable=false):
  the link/button around it carries the accessible name.
  Icons: store, phone, clock, x, facebook, instagram (header top bar), star (hero), star-pointed (hero eyebrow), menu, close (header toggle), pause, play, volume-off, volume-on (photo gallery video),
  chevron (Figma "chevron_backward": team card arrow, FAQ toggle, testimonials prev/next — points left; rotate/flip
  in CSS; callers size it). Section-only drawings live in fa-icons-team / fa-icons-testimonials / fa-icons-footer.
{%- endcomment -%}
